	"note": "Fixtures are in ./fixtures, synthetic and hand-written, except arc-too-deep.json, a generated chain of 70 nested folders, and arc-wide.json, 20 folders that each list the next twice (2^20 visits). parse: the fixture through the named parser gives exactly expected. refused: the fixture makes the named parser throw the named error (\"invalid-json\" is a SyntaxError in TS and a JsonException in C#). A file over 10 MB and a non-UTF-8 file are built at test time in the C# tests only, because the TS parsers take strings. A refusal with a message must also carry exactly that message.",
